           left the page with no top-level heading. Level is hierarchy,
           not size; the class still controls the appearance. *@
        <h1 class="main-title1 mb-mleft0" style="margin-left:27px;margin-top:7px;">XIRR Report</h1><br />
            @*<button id="btnxirrExport" style="float: right;width:35px;position: absolute; right: 226px;">
